&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners in product, marketing, solutions, and partnerships—including regional cloud and channel partners—to differentiate our offerings and sustain a competitive edge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a market expert on ASEAN&#39;s digital-native landscape, providing strategic insight to global leadership on regional trends, competitive dynamics, and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
