&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the ASEAN startup and scale-up ecosystem, including familiarity with leading digital-native companies across multiple markets in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of managing complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles and closing strategic deals by translating multifaceted technical requirements into tailored solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets in fast-paced organisations while managing an evolving pipeline and sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience negotiating complex, customised commercial agreements in Southeast Asian market contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to build relationships from ICs to C-level executives and cultural fluency across ASEAN business environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset and comfort with ambiguity as a founding team member building processes and strategy from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a related field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
