&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with agencies such as GovTech, and familiarity with national digital transformation initiatives across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and grow new market segments across multiple countries, with potential to develop into a leadership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking combined with hands-on execution capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in a regional language beyond English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for safe and ethical AI development, with the ability to articulate its importance in the public sector context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
